; Lost Zone contracts of the five faction contacts (doc 47, owner 2026-10-06).
; A chain of 10 per faction, taken in order from the contact, one at a time.
; type: hunt  - kill `count` mutants whose section contains one of `target`
;       kill  - kill `count` stalkers of the factions in `target` (NPC or player)
;       fetch - hand over `count` items of the sections in `target`
; money: RU; goodwill: the faction's attitude to the player; rank: rank points.
; Joining CS, Freedom and Duty needs `contracts` of them (factions.ltx).

